SUMMARY:Monster Wave
DESCRIPTION:Behold! Instrumental horror-themed surf rock from Asheville\, North Carolina! \nMonster Wave is a surf rock instrumental band from Asheville\, North Carolina. They are currently taking the town of Asheville by storm\, getting gigs at well known venues such as the Grey Eagle and the Orange Peel. As of writing this Monster Wave has amassed about 392 monthly listeners. \nThe music takes the scales from surf music and adds a haunting twist that really helps the band come into their own. Inspiration for the art\, live performances\, and overall vibe to the music comes from black and white monster films\, most notably The Creature From The Black Lagoon. \n\nWeekend Live Music\nHighland Brewing’s weekend live music series showcases incredible local talent\, regional acts and national touring bands from across the East Coast and beyond. Free and open to all ages (unless noted otherwise)\, it’s the perfect excuse to gather your crew\, listen and vibe to a wide range of genres including soul\, bluegrass\, acoustic\, country\, folk and more.\nLive music typically takes place on our scenic Meadow stage. Shows are rain or shine\, if the weather doesn’t cooperate and we have time to move inside\, the band will play in the Taproom where there’s still plenty of room to boogie.\nChairs\, blankets and well-behaved\, leashed pets are welcome in the Meadow. Please note that coolers and outside alcohol are not permitted on the premises.
URL:https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/monster-wave/
